  "has_quantitative_results": true,
  "summary": "The paper studies continuous-variable gate-based quantum neural networks for time-series forecasting on small datasets: IBM stock (80 points), Yahoo stock (100 points), and office energy consumption (200 points). For one-step forecasting, CVQNN test errors were 0.063/0.061/0.060 on IBM, 0.233/0.101/0.106 on Energy, and 0.0022/0.0020/0.0021 on Yahoo for 1/2/3 layers, while the classical NN baseline was better on Yahoo (0.0014/0.0013/0.0015) and worse on IBM and Energy; the multi-step Yahoo experiment reports a final MSE of 4.23×10^-7 with 3 layers.",
